        "text": "Step 10: Calculate the magnitude of \\(\\mathbf{v}\\):\n\\[\n\\|\\mathbf{v}\\| = \\sqrt{(-30)^2 + (-30)^2 + 120^2} = \\sqrt{900 + 900 + 14400} = \\sqrt{16200} = 30\\sqrt{18} = 90\\sqrt{2}.\n\\]"
